WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
Our police department responds to every single 911 call.

00:06.120 --> 00:11.180
When 911 is called and there's an emergency, our police department shows up, as they've always done.

00:11.360 --> 00:14.720
Our police officers respond to every single emergency in this city.

00:15.300 --> 00:23.520
The brave women and men who sign up to serve and protect this city are committed to keeping us safe.

